.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt NQDDIFF 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nqddiff
.Nd what changed between two capsules
.Sh LIBRARY
libnqd, \-lnqd \-lnoqtis
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In nqd.h
.Ft int
.Fn nqddiff "const char *a" "const char *b" "nqdrep **rep"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn nqddiff
compares the capsule in folder
.Fa a
with the one in
.Fa b
and reports, as
.Xr nqdchk 3
does, one failed row per difference: a
.Ql manifest
row (passed) with the file counts, or saying a folder is not sealed;
.Ql file
rows for files added, removed or changed between the manifests (read
with
.Xr nqfiles 3 ) ;
and rows named
.Ql source ,
.Ql schema ,
.Ql stats ,
.Ql check ,
.Ql env ,
.Ql cite ,
.Ql steps
and
.Ql commits
for the differences of the data records, as
.Xr noqtis-diff 1
describes.
Nothing is checked.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Dv NQOK
when nothing differs,
.Dv NQEVRFY
when something does, with
.Fa *rep
set in both cases;
.Dv NQEARG
or
.Dv NQEMEM
without a report.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr noqtis-diff 1 ,
.Xr nqdchk 3 ,
.Xr nqfiles 3 ,
.Xr noqtis-data 5
